# Translate a cue
@scenario office_lesson_14
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk neutral]
pip: Our office says goodbye in two languages. Keep a stable key so the script can be reused.
pip: i18n:office.signoff
pip: That goodbye came from config/locales/en.properties. Edit office.signoff and replay this line.
@label check
pip: What should stay the same when you rewrite a translation?
> Every character of the translated sentence. -> retry
> Its lookup key. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Stable keys let the same scene select a different localized line. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Stable keys let the same scene select a different localized line.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_14]
[flag tutorial_done_14]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_3]
